'''Birch leaves''' are evergreen [[leaves]] that form the canopy of [[birch]] trees.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
[[Hoe]]s are the default tools for breaking leaves, but leaves can be obtained only with [[shears]] or tools [[enchanted]] with [[Silk Touch]].

{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Birch Leaves|Hoe|drop=0|shears=1|sword=0}}

